<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "システム音\The_Lampe.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Thank you for your hard work, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama. You have reached the first ending of the True Jusatsu Arc.<PG>
Honestly, I had thought it would end with a little more hope, but it was a tragedy like none before.<PG>
Nevertheless, there were many clues, were there not?<PG>
When one is bathed in second-generation blood, one changes into the third generation―the green-eyed―and is tormented by strong murderous intent toward beings of the same kind.<PG>
I feel I am beginning, somehow, to see what my murderous intent toward Natsumi truly was.<PG>
What do you think, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama? Has the truth begun to come into view for you?
{PAUSE ""}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
